msgid "VoD country"
msgstr "VoD-Land"

msgid "Select the country that the VoD list will be created for."
msgstr "Auswahl des Landes, für das die VoD-Liste erstellt wird."

msgid "Live-TV bouquet %s"
msgstr "Live-TV-Bouquet %s"

msgid "Country for which Live-TV bouquet %s will be created."
msgstr "Für welches Land soll das Live-TV-Bouquet '%s' erstellt werden?"

msgid "Live TV mode"
msgstr "Live-TV-Modus"

msgid "Select the stream provider. Stitcher uses the native Pluto server with JWT auth (resolved at playback). JMP2 uses the jmp2.uk proxy. i.mjh.nz uses Matt Huisman's community playlist. Requires bouquet update to take effect."
msgstr "Wähle Stream-Provider aus."

msgid "Picon type"
msgstr "Picon-Typ"

msgid "Using service name picons means they will continue to work even if the service reference changes. Also, they can be shared between channels of the same name that don't have the same service references."
msgstr "Picons mit Servicenamen funktionieren auch, wenn sich die Service-Referenz ändert. Sie können auch von Kanälen mit unterschiedlichen Service-Referenzen geteilt werden."

msgid "Automatic update check"
msgstr "Automatische Update-Überprüfung"

msgid "Automatically check for a newer package update when the plugin GUI is opened."
msgstr "Beim Öffnen des Plugins überprüfen, ob eine neuere Plugin-Version verfügbar ist."

msgid "Data location"
msgstr "Daten-Verzeichnis"

msgid "Location the config data are stored in."
msgstr "Verzeichnis der Konfigurationsdaten"

msgid "Log level"
msgstr "Log-Stufe"

msgid "Select the level for debug logging."
msgstr "Auswahl der Debug-Log-Stufe"

msgid "Loading data... Please wait"
msgstr "Lade Daten - bitte warten..."

msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Beenden"

msgid "TMDb Search"
msgstr "TMDb Suche"

msgid "IMDb Search"
msgstr "IMDb Suche"

